  "tagline": "AI-native C++ database for hybrid search over dense, sparse, multi-vector (tensor) and full text.",
  "description": "Infinity is an open-source database from InfiniFlow, the team behind the RAGFlow RAG engine, built specifically for retrieval in LLM applications. It stores tables with dense vectors, sparse vectors, tensors for late-interaction (ColBERT-style) ranking and full-text fields, and fuses them in one query with reciprocal-rank or weighted fusion and re-ranking. It runs as a server or embedded in Python and is written in modern C++20. A capable engine for advanced hybrid RAG, though its ecosystem and track record outside RAGFlow are still small.",
